<parameternamelist>
<parametername>RecoverableErrorHandler</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>- any issues that don&apos;t prevent further parsing of the table will be reported through this handler. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
